#. module: suite_ai_provider_pool
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:suite_ai_provider_pool.field_res_config_settings__suite_selfhosted_key
msgid ""
"Optional bearer token for servers that require authentication. Leave empty "
"for local Ollama instances without auth. If the environment variable "
"ODOO_AI_SELFHOSTED_TOKEN is set, it overrides this value."
msgstr ""

#. module: suite_ai_provider_pool
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:suite_ai_provider_pool.field_res_config_settings__suite_tavily_key
msgid ""
"Optional. Enables web search for DeepSeek and self-hosted models (which have"
" no built-in search) via Tavily. Get a key at tavily.com. Not needed for "
"OpenAI, Gemini or Claude, which search natively. Results are localized to "
"your company's country. If the environment variable ODOO_AI_TAVILY_TOKEN is "
"set, it overrides this value. Leave empty to disable Tavily search."
msgstr ""

#. module: suite_ai_provider_pool
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:suite_ai_provider_pool.res_config_settings_view_form_suite_ai_provider_pool
msgid ""
"Optional. OpenAI, Gemini and Claude search the web natively; DeepSeek and "
"self-hosted models don't, so they use Tavily. Set the key here, then turn on"
" 'Search the Web' on the AI Agent. Results are localized to your company's "
"country."
msgstr ""

